/*
 * Nordic nRF54LM20 DK overlay — phase 1 bring-up.
 *
 * Nothing to override yet: the DK's devicetree already chooses &uart20 as the
 * console (the HAL's serial link), defines the on-board LEDs/buttons the HAL
 * maps the logical pins to (hal_zephyr.cpp map_pin), and provides a
 * storage_partition for NVS (SAVE/autorun).
 *
 * Phase 2 (real components on the headers) adds here:
 *  - &pwm20 channels for the buzzer (TONE), servo (SERVO) and L298N motor
 *    enables (MOVE) — pinctrl on P1/P3 (the PWM-capable domain);
 *  - a SAADC channel + zephyr,user io-channels for AREAD (P0.03);
 *  - an I2S node for the INMP441 microphone (VOICE()).
 */
